ps://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/deployments","created_at":"2026-08-05T16:00:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T17:31:44Z","pushed_at":"2026-09-23T18:17:10Z","git_url":"git://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:Agent-Field/CodeAF.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF","homepage":"http://agentfield.ai/","size":196153,"stargazers_count":116,"watchers_count":116,"language":"Go","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":14,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":141,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["agent-fleet","agent-harness","agentfield","agentic-coding","ai","ai-coding","cli-agent","coding-agent","coding-agents","coding-assistant","coding-cli","coding-harness","developer-tools","harness","harness-engineering","llm","open-models","open-source-models","software-factory","terminal-agent"],"visibility":"public","forks":14,"open_issues":141,"watchers":116,"default_branch":"dev","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pulls/1365","html_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pull/1365","diff_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pull/1365.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pull/1365.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-22T03:12:24Z"},"body":"Skills, end to end, onto the preview branch.\n\n## What a person can do now that they could not\n\n- Put a skill in front of the conversation by hand. `/skill` opens a picker over\n  every skill it found, and the attached ones ride as a tray chip.\n- Have the right skill chosen by the words of the message, without attaching\n  anything. Attachments come first and are never windowed out.\n- See which skills a turn carried, while it runs.\n- Ask the manual what a skill is and what a missed name answers.\n\nSkills are discovered under six roots in the project and in the home directory:\n`.codeaf/skills`, `.agents/skills`, `.claude/skills`, `.codex/skills`,\n`.cursor/skills`, `.gemini/skills`. A skill already on the machine is registered\nin place, not copied.\n\n## Proven against a real model\n\nThe tmux suite drove the real binary against a real model, in a project with one\nskill on the shelf:\n\n- the picker lists it, with its own description and where it came from\n- the turn's row names it while the turn runs\n- the model answered in the skill's own format, which is the only proof that the\n  skill reached it rather than being merely drawn\n\n## One defect found and left open\n\nAfter the turn settles, the skills row is folded away with the rest of the\nmachinery and expanding the chip does not bring it back. #1363 has the mechanism\nand two ways to fix it. The obvious flag was tried here and reverted: a told note\nsuppresses the work chip for the whole turn, which is a worse surface than the\nrow being folded.\n\n## Also in here\n\n- The wait-forever change entry names the pull request that merged it. It said\n  1344, which is an unrelated open issue, and the check could not catch it\n  because the filename and the field agreed with each other.\n- `poem/` and `.aforge/autonomy.json` are gone. Two files a model wrote while a\n  test drove it, and one machine's answer to the autonomy question, swept in by a\n  `git add -A` in a tree several sessions were working in.\n\n## Gate\n\nFull check on the build box at `d91bb63a`, tree identical to the one that\nalready passed, plus this branch's merge of the current preview head.\n\n```\nbuild 0   windows build 0   vet 0   gofmt clean   change entries 99 well formed\nlaws 0    all other packages 0\ninternal/session  ok  243.218s\ninternal/tui3     ok  327.560s\n```\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1365/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1365/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":31697896092,"node_id":"LE_lADOTu5AHM8AAAABSeXjtc8AAAAHYVeCnA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/events/31697896092","actor":{"login":"santoshkumarradha","id":29346072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzQ2MDcy","ava